<title>USA: Apache expands commercial paper program.</title>
<headline>Apache expands commercial paper program.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apache Corp expanded its commercial paper program to $700 million from $300 million, giving the company low-cost, short-term funds.</p>
<p>Also, the company said in a statement on Tuesday that it has replaced its $1 billion dollar credit facility with a new billion dollar global credit facility.</p>
</text>
